      "text": {
        "en": "The clinical and support team at North Center Animal Hospital receives widespread praise from long-term clients and new pet parents alike. Reviewers frequently commend Dr. Courtney, Dr. Locher, and technical staff for kindness, patience, and attentive care. Clients consistently note that veterinarians take the time to explain diagnoses thoroughly and treat pets with family-like affection."
      }
    },
    {
