      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling during exams and transitions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet handling receives steady appreciation across routine wellness visits, surgeries, and compassionate end-of-life care. Clients note that anxious pets are treated with patience, gentle handling, and treats to help them feel at ease. Multiple pet owners emphasize the dignity, emotional support, and peaceful environment created by staff during difficult moments of grief."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable surgical and preventative care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Treatment outcomes earn strong commendation from pet owners navigating both routine health needs and complex surgical procedures. Clients share that surgical interventions for boxers and chronic illnesses in older dogs were handled effectively. Reviewers express lasting confidence in the clinical advice, noting positive health recoveries across years of continuous care."
      }
    }
